  "body": "## Features\r\n- **syllabifier**: trim leading delimiters (#1147) [#1147](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1147) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/4ff27f8fe3de3d1b388802ad9f53db0a8ee0bf7f))\r\n- **navigator**: 允許跳轉到分隔符之前 (#1142) [#1142](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1142) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/2b7ccf2d93d15ed0ad3a88f92f31957b88bfd439))\r\n- **poet**: make multiple sentences [#1164](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1164) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/d32cd32610f7537a871593d0010d5cdbb2f8601b))\r\n- **script_translator**: allow multiple sentence candidates [#1164](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1164) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/9422ca7e9c36a4516d7c15186ecd42f4e0dad7a0))\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- **script_translator**: excluded words cause crashes (#1152) [#1152](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1152) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/4218af04babbe71d3e9b2f3aaf910d225064c80c))\r\n- **navigator**: forward/rewind 步長視未選定編碼分節數而定 ([居戎氏](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/3a0bafaf0f6417668fff6ee8da66bbf27e1262a4))\r\n- **build**: commit ci should also build with plugins (#1160) [#1160](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1160) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/422ad2d625346947a2d77c3924322aceb39e23d9))\r\n- **punctuator**: space after digit separators shouldn't be translated [#1167](https://github.com/rime/librime/pull/1167) ([ksqsf](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/aa32d48eb440c74f9f57b89089208cf03792159b))\r\n- **charset_filter**: 不過濾漢字以外的符號 ([居戎氏](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/1300e568967feeeedd72028c7cb5ef9151f7fb37))\r\n\r\n## Chores\r\n- **release**: 1.17.0 :tada: ([居戎氏](https://github.com/rime/librime/commit/33e78140250125871856cdc5b42ddc6a5fcd3cd4))",
